  "prefLabel": "Rev 2703.01 Nursing Facility Records and Information",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-06-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2703.01 Nursing Facility Records and Information. Every nursing facility shall maintain all accounting, financial, or general records and information necessary to establish the amount of net patient services revenues or other information required to be shown on any return, schedule or attachment pursuant to the requirements under RSA 84-C:8.\n\nSource. #8226, INTERIM, eff 12-10-04, EXPIRES: 6-8-05; ss by #8371, eff 6-8-05; ss by #10387, eff 7-25-13; ss by #13661, eff 6-21-23",
